  "reviewNotes": [
    "SECURITY DEFINER call-graph labels are navigation aids, not branch-level authorization proofs. Actual review found and fixed account-status and private-price gaps listed here.",
    "list_badge_catalog exposes only the public badge catalog; list_interest_catalog exposes static categories and is replaced with a filtered invoker in Admin catalog migration.",
    "save_my_partner_profile delegates to an always-raising obsolete-application endpoint and cannot save payout or Partner data.",
    "submit_my_live_photo and sync_my_verification gain live account guards in75305. list_active_stories previously used current user only for viewed decoration, and gains a WHERE authorization predicate.",
    "Admin and Finance RPCs use fresh auth.users app_metadata via current_admin_role, not user_metadata or stale JWT role claims.",
    "Do not report security advisories clean: 137 predeployment authenticated definer WARNs and leaked password protection WARN remain in snapshot. Rerun after integration/deployment."
  ]
}
